{
 "duration": 28.129,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Ben flew in from Florida and hit the trail the next morning.",
   "start": 0.35,
   "end": 3.65
  },
  {
   "text": "Ten minutes in, he was gasping, with a pounding headache.",
   "start": 3.95,
   "end": 6.925
  },
  {
   "text": "Most trailheads in Rocky sit between eight thousand and nine thousand five hundred feet.",
   "start": 7.325,
   "end": 12.617
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix. Make day one an easy, flat walk.",
   "start": 13.067,
   "end": 16.178
  },
  {
   "text": "Go slow enough to talk.",
   "start": 16.478,
   "end": 17.783
  },
  {
   "text": "Drink water and eat.",
   "start": 18.083,
   "end": 19.28
  },
  {
   "text": "If the headache gets worse or you feel dizzy, head back down.",
   "start": 19.58,
   "end": 22.876
  },
  {
   "text": "On day three, he made it to the frozen lake.",
   "start": 23.326,
   "end": 25.815
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your Rocky trip.",
   "start": 26.265,
   "end": 27.929
  }
 ],
